  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING: removed SendAsync, PinqloqSendResult, and the SinglePath option. All logs are now delivered through the buffered and batched Enqueue pipeline. Use onSent and onFailed callbacks to observe delivery outcomes. Rejected batches are reported to the application log with throttling and the server response body. This release also includes the revised README and documentation links.",
